  m_Name: Story_introduct_120
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  type: 1
  description: 
  sentences:
    nameNPC: "\u0110inh \u0110i\u1EC1n"
    Lines:
    - "Cu\u1ED1i n\u0103m 965, \u0110inh Ho\xE0n v\u1EC1 B\u1ED1 H\u1EA3i, ch\xEDnh
      th\u1EE9c tr\u1EDF th\xE0nh t\u01B0\u1EDBng d\u01B0\u1EDBi tr\u01B0\u1EDBng
      Tr\u1EA7n L\xE3m."
    - "N\u0103m 966, theo l\u1EC7nh Tr\u1EA7n L\xE3m, \u0110inh Ho\xE0n c\u1EA7m
      qu\xE2n \u0111\xE1nh phe ti\u1EBFm quy\u1EC1n L\xE3 X\u1EED B\xECnh, chi\u1EBFm
      l\u1EA1i C\u1ED5 Loa.L\u1EA5y s\u1EED c\u1EE7a 1 to\xE0n qu\xE2n nh\u1ECF,
      d\u1EB9p \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c 1 x\u1EE9 qu\xE2n. Th\u1EAFng l\u1EE3i n\xE0y
      khi\u1EBFn uy t\xEDn c\u1EE7a \u0110inh Ho\xE0n v\u01B0\u1EE3t tr\u1ED9i trong
      qu\xE2n B\u1ED1 H\u1EA3i."
    - "Cu\u1ED1i n\u0103m 966, Tr\u1EA7n L\xE3m tri\u1EC7u \u0110inh Ho\xE0n v\xE0o
      doanh, n\xF3i r\xF5 \xFD \u0111\u1ECBnh: \u201CTa \u0111\xE3 gi\xE0, kh\xF4ng
      con trai. Ta nh\u1EADn ng\u01B0\u01A1i l\xE0m con.\u201D \u0110inh Ho\xE0n
      b\xE1i nh\u1EADn. T\u1EEB \u0111\xE2y \xF4ng l\xE0 con nu\xF4i v\xE0 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
      k\u1EBF th\u1EEBa \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ch\u1EC9 \u0111\u1ECBnh c\u1EE7a Tr\u1EA7n
      L\xE3m."
    - "Sau khi nh\u1EADn v\u1EC1 d\u01B0\u1EDBi th\xE2n ph\u1EADn con nu\xF4i c\u1EE7a
      Tr\u1EA7n L\xE3m, v\u1EDBi kh\xED th\u1EBF ng\xF9n ng\u1EE5t c\u1EE7a tr\u1EADn
      chi\u1EBFn d\u1EB9p lo\u1EA1n qu\xE2n L\xE3 X\u1EE9 B\xECnh, \u0110inh Ho\xE0n
      quy\u1EBFt \u0111inh \u0111\u01B0a ra quy\u1EBFt \u0111inh: \"Giao Ch\xE2u
      \u0111\xE3 lo\u1EA1n qu\xE1 l\xE2u. D\xE2n kh\xF4ng c\xF3 ch\u1EE7, n\u01B0\u1EDBc
      kh\xF4ng c\xF3 vua. Ta s\u1EBD th\u1ED1ng nh\u1EA5t thi\xEAn h\u1EA1, l\u1EADp
      n\xEAn m\u1ED9t tri\u1EC1u \u0111\u1EA1i m\u1EDBi!\""
    images:
    - {fileID: 21300000, guid: ba370862297078040bbce71838be441a, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 21300000, guid: ba370862297078040bbce71838be441a, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 21300000, guid: ba370862297078040bbce71838be441a, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 21300000, guid: ba370862297078040bbce71838be441a, type: 3}
  choices: []
  nextConversation: {fileID: 0}
  isCanonical: 1
  canonical: "S\u1EED ch\xE9p \u0110inh B\u1ED9 L\u0129nh ra n\u01B0\u01A1ng Tr\u1EA7n
    Minh C\xF4ng \u1EDF B\u1ED1 H\u1EA3i Kh\u1EA9u; n\u0103m 966 theo l\u1EC7nh \xF4ng
    \u0111\xE1nh L\xE3 X\u1EED B\xECnh, chi\u1EBFm l\u1EA1i C\u1ED5 Loa, thanh th\u1EBF
    vang d\u1ED9i. T\u1EEB \u0111\xF3, Tr\u1EA7n L\xE3m nh\u1EADn l\xE0m con nu\xF4i
    v\xE0 giao quy\u1EC1n ch\u1EC9 huy; \u0111\u1EBFn 967 Tr\u1EA7n m\u1EA5t, \u0110inh
    k\u1EBF th\u1EEBa binh l\u1EF1c. Chi ti\u1EBFt \u201Cgiao chi\u1EBFn \u1EDF B\u1ED1
    H\u1EA3i\u201D hay \u201Cqu\xE2n s\u01B0, v\xE2y r\u1ED3i tho\xE1t\u201D ch\u1EC9
    l\xE0 truy\u1EC1n thuy\u1EBFt sau n\xE0y, kh\xF4ng c\xF3 th\xF4ng tin r\xF5 r\xE0ng
    trong ch\xEDnh s\u1EED."
